rooms_desc ({"This room is ugly indeed. It looks like Holy Mission's villagedump. The smell is disgusting and the shining sun hurts youreyes. The whole place is filled with empty and half emptybottles, damaged and even more damaged instruments and theremains of what happened to be a bed.In one of the many corners of this room there is a prettybig harp standing. You remember, Xeno told you something abouthis 'magic' harp...",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
